Hello, our name is Customertimes, but you can call us CT. We are a global digital engineering, product development, and technology consulting company. Headquartered in New York, we have a team of 1000+ experts working across 65+ countries.

Location: Bangalore 

How you'll make an impact:

Senior full-stack developers with knowledge of React and 5+ years of experience:

- Design and develop scalable front-end applications using React and JavaScript/TypeScript;
- Design and implement backend services, APIs, and integrations using Node.js;
- Develop and optimize database solutions using SQL, including complex queries and performance tuning;
- Diagnose complex application, integration, database, and production issues;
- Contribute to CI/CD, application security, performance, reliability, and production readiness;
- Provide technical guidance and mentoring to Junior and Middle developers.

Middle full-stack Developers:

- Develop and maintain front-end applications using React, JavaScript/TypeScript, HTML, and CSS;
- Build and support backend services and REST APIs using Node.js;
- Design and develop database queries, stored procedures, and data integrations using SQL;
- Participate in application design, development, testing, deployment, and production support;
- Troubleshoot application defects and performance issues across the full technology stack;
- Participate in code reviews and collaborate with QA, Product, BA, and other engineering team members.

If you're looking to contribute to global projects, grow your skills, shape the way you work, and be part of a connected international community — Customertimes is the place to build your next career chapter. Are you ready to spark the tech with us?

